# freshcv2

**This is my live CV**, created to connect more easily with employers. It provides links to my profiles on Indeed, Twitter, and LinkedIn to stay in touch.

## Features

- **Interactive CV**: Showcases my professional information in an engaging format.
- **Redirect to social platforms**: Offers quick access to:
  - **Indeed**: [My Indeed Page](#)
  - **Twitter**: https://x.com/adrian_ciociu(#)
  - **LinkedIn**: https://www.linkedin.com/in/virgil-adrian-ciociu-3a6122b4(#)
- **Responsive design**: Perfectly adapts to any device, from desktops to smartphones.

